    "url": "/api/v2/item-category/12/"
  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "光にあてると　淡く光る　ハネ。持たせると　フェアリータイプの技の威力が　あがる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "빛에 비추면 희미하게 빛나는 깃털. 지니게 하면 페어리타입 기술의 위력이 올라간다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "被光照到後會微微發光的羽毛。攜帶後，妖精屬性的招式威力就會提高。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Objet à tenir. Cette plume augmente la puissance des capacités de type Fée. Elle brille d’une pâle lueur lorsqu’on l’expose à la lumière.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein Item zum Tragen. Diese Feder, die im Licht sanft leuchtet, verstärkt Attacken vom Typ Fee.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Pluma que brilla tenuemente cuando entra en contacto con la luz y que potencia los movimientos de tipo Hada. Debe llevarla un Pokémon.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Strumento da dare a un Pokémon. Piuma che brilla debolmente alla luce e potenzia le mosse di tipo Folletto.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "An item to be held by a Pokémon. This feather, which gleams faintly when hit by light, boosts the power of the holder’s Fairy-type moves.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "光にあてると　淡く光る　ハネ。持たせると　フェアリータイプの技の威力が　あがる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "接触到光后就会微微发光的羽毛。携带后，妖精属性的招式威力就会提高。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
